{"id":"3ce7c5a609936246","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-ideal-ideal-uniformity.md","title":"ZFC Ideal Ideal Uniformity","display":"df-zfc-ideal-ideal-uniformity — ZFC Ideal Ideal Uniformity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal-ideal-uniformity","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal-ideal-uniformity"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal-ideal-uniformity — ZFC Ideal Ideal Uniformity","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-ideal]]","[[58-df-set]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal-ideal-uniformity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal-ideal-uniformity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal-ideal-uniformity — ZFC Ideal Ideal Uniformity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\mathcal I,X\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\mathcal I,X\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span> (ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdealIdealUniformity}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdealIdealUniformity}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}uniformity} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealIdealUniformity}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal I,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists A\\subseteq X\\;(A\\notin\\mathcal I\\land |A|=\\kappa)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;(B\\notin\\mathcal I\\to\\kappa\\leq|B|)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}uniformity} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealIdealUniformity}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal I,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists A\\subseteq X\\;(A\\notin\\mathcal I\\land |A|=\\kappa)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;(B\\notin\\mathcal I\\to\\kappa\\leq|B|)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is the least cardinality of an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span>-positive subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>; existence and minimality are stated separately, so no partial minimum operator is used.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ideal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}$ (ideal predicate, see [[58-df-ideal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa,\\mathcal I,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcIdealIdealUniformity}_S","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}uniformity} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealIdealUniformity}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal I,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists A\\subseteq X\\;(A\\notin\\mathcal I\\land |A|=\\kappa)\\land\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;(B\\notin\\mathcal I\\to\\kappa\\leq|B|)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1336,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2277","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-ideal-ideal-uniformity.md|58-df-zfc-ideal-ideal-uniformity]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5fb1c2241d1943d1","6e4f95381faac4f9","65d9a1e690c32aad","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}